ext influences action, lineage should be preserved."}]},{"id":"blk-10449","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9870","text":"Anti-pattern 4: using graph memory for everything"}]},{"id":"blk-10450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9871","text":"Not every retrieval problem is best solved by graph structure alone. In many systems, "},{"id":"spn-9872","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9873","text":" works best alongside "},{"id":"spn-9874","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9875","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-9876","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-9877","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-10451","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9878","text":"16. Related capabilities"}]},{"id":"blk-10452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9879","text":"Closest related protocol capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-10453","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9880","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"}]}],"id":"blk-10454","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9881","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"}]}],"id":"blk-10456","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9882","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-10458","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9883","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"}]}],"id":"blk-10460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9884","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"}]}],"id":"blk-10462","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9885","text":"Common high-value compositions:"}]},{"id":"blk-10465","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9886","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-9887","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9888","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9889","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9890","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-10466","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9891","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9892","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9893","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-9894","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9895","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.plan"}]}],"id":"blk-10468","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10471","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9896","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9897","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9898","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-9899","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-9900","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-10470","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10472","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9901","text":"17. Research references"}]},{"id":"blk-10473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9902","text":"This capability is informed by both memory-systems research and modern agent memory architecture work."}]},{"id":"blk-10474","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9903","text":"Useful reference directions:"}]},{"id":"blk-10475","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9904","text":"Atkinson & Shiffrin — staged memory models"}]}],"id":"blk-10476","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10479","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9905","text":"Endel Tulving — episodic vs semantic memory distinction"}]}],"id":"blk-10478","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9906","text":"Alan Baddeley — working memory and active memory use"}]}],"id":"blk-10480","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10483","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9907","text":"Larry Squire and related memory-systems research"}]}],"id":"blk-10482","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10485","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9908","text":"modern knowledge graph and graph retrieval systems"}]}],"id":"blk-10484","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10487","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9909","text":"graph-based agent memory architectures"}]}],"id":"blk-10486","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10489","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9910","text":"retrieval-augmented reasoning systems with structured memory"}]}],"id":"blk-10488","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10490","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9911","text":"The protocol does not claim to reproduce neuroscience literally. The value of these references is that they support treating memory as a family of functions rather than one monolithic feature."}]},{"id":"blk-10491","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9912","text":"18. Summary"}]},{"id":"blk-10492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9913","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9914","text":" is the [&] Protocol capability for graph-structured memory."}]},{"id":"blk-10493","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9915","text":"It is the right capability when an agent needs:"}]},{"id":"blk-10494","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9916","text":"durable structured recall"}]}],"id":"blk-10495","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10498","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9917","text":"relationship-aware enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-10497","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9918","text":"connected incident or research context"}]}],"id":"blk-10499","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9919","text":"continual learning into linked knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-10501","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9920","text":"explainable memory that preserves structure"}]}],"id":"blk-10503","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-10505","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9921","text":"In one sentence:"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-10507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9922","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9923","text":" lets an agent remember not only facts, but how those facts connect."}]}],"id":"blk-10506","kind":"quote"}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera3cgg7j6og4rx5xbff6hargg4hjyaojgzb5oxl35nsbdcitid3nfa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}